{"id":"sencillamente","lemma":"sencillamente","pos":"adv","rank":4797,"glosses":["in a simple manner"],"ipa":"/senˌθiʝaˈmente/","examples":[{"text":"Sencillamente no sé qué decir.","en":"I just don't know what to say.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/553569","words":[null,null,null,null,{"g":"to say"}],"phrases":[[1,4,"je ne sais quoi"]]},{"text":"Sencillamente no parece posible.","en":"It just doesn't seem possible.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/306349","words":[null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to seem, to see fit","l":"parecer"},{"g":"possible"}]},{"text":"Ayer sencillamente no era mi día.","en":"It just was not my day yesterday.","words":[{"g":"yesterday"},null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"day"}]},{"text":"Sencillamente no me gusta.","en":"I just don't like it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454505","words":[null,{"g":"no / not"},null,null],"phrases":[[2,4,"like, thumbs up"]]},{"text":"No puedo sencillamente hacer nada.","en":"I can't just do nothing.","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},null,{"g":"to do"},{"g":"nothing"}]}]}